# The `hep-talk` package

Slides with overlays based on the article class, with colour themes

## Introduction

The `hep-talk` package provides a lightweight slide system for HEP talks.
It sets slide geometry from the requested paper width and aspect ratio,
loads the HEP font, math-font, bibliography, title, and text modules, and
defines block, column, row, frame, and slide environments with overlay
support. It also provides title-logo handling, slide page numbers,
slide-oriented citation and bibliography formatting, and dark, light,
blue, and metropolis-inspired colour themes.

It can be loaded with `\usepackage{hep-talk}`.

